  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/znHQQtuU/images/653b6f24f05341edcd3cba3164edd0b8d2c0dd71.png\" alt=\"More Delight\" width=\"408\" height=\"111\"></p>\n<p><strong>踏上更豐富的料理旅程</strong>，體驗 More Delight。這是一款專為 Farmer's Delight 設計的模組，增添了更多餐點、刀具與食材。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-delight-forge/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/to1Ri2x.png\" alt=\"下載更新\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-delight-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KXy6vrX.png\" alt=\"Fabric 版下載\" width=\"174\" height=\"36\"></a></p>\n<h2>🍽️ 功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用全新餐點與食材豐富您的菜單。</li>\n<li>輕鬆使用麵包片製作三明治。</li>\n<li>享受用麵包片烤製的酥脆吐司。</li>\n<li>配備木製與石製刀具，提升料理精度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🛠️ 相容模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Expanded Delight</li>\n<li>Casualness Delight</li>\n<li>Supplementaries</li>\n<li>Create</li>\n<li>Some Assembly Required</li>\n</ul>\n<p>這些餐點中的許多靈感，來自於我女朋友烹飪的美味佳餚。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"正在儲蓄購買新筆電！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"支持作者按鈕\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐贈按鈕\"></a></p>",
